y6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q5. What is the last date to apply online for National Insurance NICL Assistant Recruitment 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>07 August 2026..</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Q6. What is the last date to pay the application fee?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">07 August 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q7. How can I apply for National Insurance NICL Assistant Recruitment 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong></strong></strong>\n<p></p><figure id=\"attachment_29615\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-29615\" style=\"width: 2550px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-29615\" title=\"National Insurance NICL\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/National-Insurance-NICL-scaled.png\" alt=\"National Insurance NICL\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1491\" srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/National-Insurance-NICL-scaled.png 2560w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/National-Insurance-NICL-300x175.png 300w, https://www.sa